data: {"id": "5d675651b3654666-thinking-layer-1876", "run_id": "5d675651b3654666", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789122467796}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "5d675651b3654666-thinking-layer-1877", "run_id": "5d675651b3654666", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "`kubectl get` 默认不显示详细事件。我需要获取该 Pod 的详细信息（通常包含 Events）来确定 `ContainerCreating` 的具体原因。虽然 `kubectl_get_by_name` 工具描述中提到了 `--show-labels -o wide`，这通常不直接展示 Events。\n\n但在标准 K8s 诊断流程中，`describe` 是关键。观察 `kubectl_get_by_name` 的实现描述：`Run kubectl get <kind> <name> --show-labels -o wide.` 这似乎只支持 `get` 命令。\n\n如果无法直接获取 Events，我将根据 `ContainerCreating` 状态和常见故障场景进行推断。`ContainerCreating` 通常由以下原因引起：\n1.  **ImagePullBackOff/ErrImagePull**: 镜像拉取失败。\n2.  **FailedMount**: 卷挂载失败（PVC 未绑定、权限问题等）。\n3.  **CreateContainerConfigErro", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789122468421}

