event: thinking
data: {"id": "5d675651b3654666-thinking-layer-1879", "run_id": "5d675651b3654666", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "fetch_runbook", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "<runbook>\n# Pod VolumeMountFailed / 卷挂载失败\n\n> Pod异常类型: VolumeMountFailed | 典型状态: Pending / ContainerCreating | 兼容分类: storage_volume\n\n## 使用原则（给模型）\n- Runbook 是诊断 guide，不是要求把所有分支都查完的 checklist。\n- `kubectl", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789122468441}

