data: {"id": "5d675651b3654666-thinking-parallel_evidence-3082", "run_id": "5d675651b3654666", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实与冲突\n\n**确认异常存在：Pod 仍处于 `Pending`/`ContainerCreating` 状态**\n- **Kubernetes Status**: `kubectl_describe` 显示 Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 状态为 `Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting (Reason: ContainerCreating)`，且 `Restart Count: 0`。\n- **Metrics 确认**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 返回 `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"` 值为 1，`kube_pod_status_phase` 确认 `phase=\"Pending\"` 为 1，`restarts_total` 为 0。Metrics 与 K8s Events 完全一致，未处于 Recovered 状态。\n- **Topology/Tracing/Logs**: \n  - Pod 未分配 IP (`pod_ip` is e", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789122505552, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

