data: {"id": "5d675651b3654666-final", "run_id": "5d675651b3654666", "seq": 3087, "ts_ms": 1789122520508, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload stuck in ContainerCreating |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.status`: Pending (fact-2efc25987fa9) | 确认 Pod 处于等待调度的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`: unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input] (fact-8e4cea79b9ac) | 定位到具体失败的操作是挂载 `input` 卷 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key (fact-bffcd57a23ad) | 揭示失败的根本原因为配置键缺失 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` for reason `ContainerCreating` (fact-833277c039ba) | 独立观测证实容器卡在创建阶段 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `restart_count`: 0 (fact-6c5682956e3b) | 排除因资源超限导致 CrashLoopBackOff 的可能性 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Resource Request `cpu: 5m, memory: 8Mi` (fact-2a32ed74f5fa, fact-774995f6d457) | 提供上下文，排除因资源不足导致调度失败的可能 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n事实 #2 和 #3 的 `FailedMount` 事件在时间上紧密相连，事实 #3 提供了事实 #2 中挂载失败的具体技术原因（配置引用错误），两者互为表里。Metric #4 独立验证了 K8s State #1 中观察到的等待状态。由于 Pod 始终未完成挂载，Logging 和 Tracing 因容器未启动而无数据（事实 #5 显示无重启，进一步证实未进入应用运行阶段）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺少键 'unavailable-key' → Kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 失败 → Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段 → 应用无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **配置引用错误**。\n\nKubelet 在尝试挂载名为 `input` 的卷时，尝试从 ConfigMap 中读取名为 `unavailable-key` 的键，但该键在 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中并不存在（引用证据 #3, #1）。这一配置层面的错误导致挂载操作永久失败（引用证据 #2），进而阻止了容器启动和 Pod 状态的推进（引用证据 #1, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 44.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 28.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 28.4s (Evidence 22.9s, RCA 5.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 82.021, "metrics": {"run_id": "5d675651b3654666", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 82.02646231651306, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "53%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 82026.46231651306, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 79270.74217796326, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6066.889762878418, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2413.785696029